### Modulo projects — projetos, marcos, tarefas, comentarios e horas.
@api = http://localhost:8000
@token = SUBSTITUA_PELO_ACCESS_TOKEN
@tenant = SUBSTITUA_PELO_ID_DO_TENANT

### Criar projeto — sem code, ele e derivado do nome
# @name projeto
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/projects/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Implantacao do PDV",
  "code": "PDV",
  "description": "Rollout em 12 lojas",
  "startDate": "2026-09-01",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-15",
  "budgetCents": 18500000
}

###
@project = {{projeto.response.body.data.id}}

### Listar projetos
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/projects/projects?status=active&search=pdv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Ver o projeto com os marcos
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/projects/projects/{{project}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Resumo: tarefas por situacao, marcos, horas apontadas e orcamento
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/projects/projects/{{project}}/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Alterar o projeto
PATCH {{api}}/functions/v1/projects/projects/{{project}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Rollout em 15 lojas", "budgetCents": 21000000 }

### Mudar a situacao (planning, active, on_hold, completed, archived)
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/projects/projects/{{project}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "active" }

### Arquivar (a partir daqui o projeto nao aceita novas tarefas)
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/projects/projects/{{project}}/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Adicionar marco
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/projects/projects/{{project}}/milestones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Piloto em uma loja", "dueDate": "2026-10-15" }

### Criar tarefa — o responsavel precisa ser membro ativo do tenant
# @name tarefa
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/projects/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "{{project}}",
  "title": "Configurar impressoras fiscais",
  "description": "Modelo Epson TM-T20",
  "priority": "high",
  "estimateMinutes": 240,
  "dueDate": "2026-10-05"
}

###
@task = {{tarefa.response.body.data.id}}

### Criar subtarefa
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/projects/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "projectId": "{{project}}", "title": "Testar impressao de cupom", "parentTaskId": "{{task}}" }

### Listar tarefas
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/projects/tasks?projectId={{project}}&status=todo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Ver a tarefa com comentarios e apontamentos
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/projects/tasks/{{task}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Atribuir (envie sem assigneeId para desatribuir)
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/projects/tasks/{{task}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assigneeId": "UUID_DO_MEMBRO" }

### Mudar a situacao — recusado enquanto houver subtarefa em aberto
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/projects/tasks/{{task}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "done" }

### Comentar
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/projects/tasks/{{task}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Chegaram duas impressoras a menos; cobrei o fornecedor." }

### Apontar horas (1 a 1440 minutos, nunca no futuro)
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/projects/tasks/{{task}}/time-entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "minutes": 180, "spentOn": "2026-09-08", "notes": "Configuracao inicial" }
